; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696c99d46a81d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696c99d46a81d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英超第37轮比赛，布莱顿以0-1的比分不敌利兹联，这意味着仅剩伯恩茅斯能够威胁到利物浦的欧冠席位。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-18/6a0a17377ef8anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">距欧冠决赛不到两周！登贝莱登场仅27分钟伤退，直接返回更衣室</a></p><p>登贝莱在1-2不敌巴黎FC的比赛中伤退直接返回更衣室，此时距欧冠决赛仅13天，距世界杯也不足一个月！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-18/6a0a19e7ba286native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛最终位列第8无缘欧战！法兰克福官方：主帅里埃拉下课</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260518/202605180345435422.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260518/202605180345435422.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260518/202605180345435422.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法兰克福官方宣布，主帅里埃拉下课。</span></p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.pn